{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>亞洲汽車扭樽錦標賽首次在港舉行。</p><p></p><p>商務及經濟發展局局長丘應樺等出席開幕典禮，比賽一連兩日在灣仔海濱活動空間舉行，來自本地、澳洲，新加坡、吉爾吉斯及印度等地選手同場較量。車手需駕駛統一汽車在雪糕筒標誌的賽道，完成高速轉彎、急煞等高難度動作。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CAR-1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OJ2KTRy2zK1792223803.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>丘應樺指本港首次舉辦這項亞洲汽車運動盛事，為市民及遊客帶來新體驗，亦可吸引旅客來港，推動消費。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T08:59:36.330021+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T07:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T10:37:45.589703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T08:57:37.771857+00:00","content_hash":"dbf056207108634ad6bf6516e3eb2d5fcfa4eafe2bf37ca1d8973147ff31ffca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}